# Suricata Detection Rules - Generated 2026-09-29
# Based on: GitHub Advisory Database CVEs (2026-08-27 to 2026-09-29)
# MITRE ATT&CK techniques, current threat landscape
# SIDs: 5208902 - 5209001

# === CVE-based detections ===

# CVE-2026-101895: Angular SSR DoS via malformed DOCTYPE
alert http $HOME_NET any -> $EXTERNAL_NET $HTTP_PORTS (msg:"CVE-2026-101895 Angular SSR DoS via Malformed DOCTYPE Detection"; flow:to_server,established; content:"<!DOCTYPE"; nocase; pcre:"/<!(?i)DOCTYPE[^>]*\{/"; content:"Content-Type|3a| text/html"; http_header; detection_filter:track by_src, count 5, seconds 10; reference:cve,2026-101895; classtype:attempted-dos; sid:5208902; rev:1;)

# CVE-2026-88058: Angular SSR XSS via processing instruction nodes
